OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F110A1793372110
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ACrypto giant Binance hit by $6.3bn hack
OL,4,Asuspected to be largest in history
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said while initial checks
OL,7,Fsuggested an engineer's laptop had been
OL,8,Fcompromised, allowing an attacker to
OL,9,Fmake unauthorised withdrawals, "our
OL,10,Fsubsequent investigation has uncovered
OL,11,Fadditional points of breach".
OL,13,FTwo analytics firms have attributed the
OL,14,Fincident, which eclipses a
OL,15,Frecord-setting $1.5bn hack on the Bybit
OL,16,Fexchange in 2025, to a North Korean
OL,17,Fhacking unit called TraderTraitor.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,111,105,200,160,0,100
